{
  "bookId": "PSA",
  "chapter": 92,
  "bookEnglish": "Psalms",
  "bookChineseSimplified": "诗篇",
  "bookChineseTraditional": "詩篇",
  "verses": [
    {
      "verse": "1",
      "en": {
        "text": "It is a good thing to give thanks to the LORD, to sing praises to your name, Most High,",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "称谢耶和华！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "稱謝耶和華！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "2",
      "en": {
        "text": "to proclaim your loving kindness in the morning, and your faithfulness every night,",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "2-3",
      "en": {
        "text": "",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "用十弦的乐器和瑟，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "用十弦的樂器和瑟，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "3",
      "en": {
        "text": "with the ten-stringed lute, with the harp, and with the melody of the lyre.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "4",
      "en": {
        "text": "For you, LORD, have made me glad through your work. I will triumph in the works of your hands.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "因你—耶和华借着你的作为叫我高兴，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "因你－耶和華藉着你的作為叫我高興，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "5",
      "en": {
        "text": "How great are your works, LORD! Your thoughts are very deep.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "耶和华啊，你的工作何其大！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "耶和華啊，你的工作何其大！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "6",
      "en": {
        "text": "A senseless man doesn’t know, does a fool understand this:",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "畜类人不晓得；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "畜類人不曉得；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "7",
      "en": {
        "text": "though the wicked spring up as the grass, and all the evildoers flourish, they will be destroyed forever.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "恶人茂盛如草，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "惡人茂盛如草，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "8",
      "en": {
        "text": "But you, LORD, are on high forever more.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "惟你—耶和华是至高，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "惟你－耶和華是至高，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "9",
      "en": {
        "text": "For behold, your enemies, LORD, for behold, your enemies shall perish. All the evildoers will be scattered.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "耶和华啊，你的仇敌都要灭亡；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "耶和華啊，你的仇敵都要滅亡；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "10",
      "en": {
        "text": "But you have exalted my horn like that of the wild ox. I am anointed with fresh oil.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "你却高举了我的角，如野牛的角；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "你卻高舉了我的角，如野牛的角；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "11",
      "en": {
        "text": "My eye has also seen my enemies. My ears have heard of the wicked enemies who rise up against me.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "我眼睛看见仇敌； 。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "我眼睛看見仇敵； 。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "12",
      "en": {
        "text": "The righteous shall flourish like the palm tree. He will grow like a cedar in Lebanon.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "义人要发旺如棕树， 的香柏树。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "義人要發旺如棕樹， 的香柏樹。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "13",
      "en": {
        "text": "They are planted in the LORD’s house. will flourish in our God’s courts.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他们栽于耶和华的殿中，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他們栽於耶和華的殿中，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "14",
      "en": {
        "text": "They will still produce fruit in old age. They will be full of sap and green,",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他们年老的时候仍要结果子，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他們年老的時候仍要結果子，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "15",
      "en": {
        "text": "to show that the LORD is upright. is my rock, and there is no unrighteousness in him.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "好显明耶和华是正直的。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "好顯明耶和華是正直的。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    }
  ]
}